# Source and docs are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as LF
# on every platform, so rustfmt and CI agree on Windows and Ubuntu.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are byte-exact evidence. Never translate their line endings: boundary
# case B8 in docs/TDD.md exists precisely to check CRLF handling, and a fixture
# whose bytes change on checkout cannot test that.
tests/fixtures/** -text
